      <title>PSP’s Momei Qu on Anthropic’s Pre-IPO Investor Day</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-10-13/psp-s-momei-qu-on-anthropic-s-pre-ipo-investor-day-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">1c22b9227a33c786cd467da7</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:11:41 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Ahead of Anthropic’s pre-IPO investor day, Momei Qu of PSP Growth says public-market investors may disagree over whether fast-growing AI companies deserve lower margins and heavy capital spending—or must prove stronger returns and profitability. Recent IPO setbacks, including a collapse in Asia and Aura’s withdrawal, illustrate the uncertainty facing both AI firms beyond Anthropic and companies outside the sector. She speaks with Scarlet Fu &amp; Hema Parmar on "The Close." (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
